{"id":"unterhaltung","lemma":"Unterhaltung","pos":"noun","rank":1734,"glosses":["conversation","entertainment"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f4/De-at-Unterhaltung.ogg/De-at-Unterhaltung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Unterhaltung","plural":"Unterhaltungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich hatte eine nette Unterhaltung mit ihr.","en":"I had a nice chat with her.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"nice","l":"nett"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"}]},{"text":"Die Unterhaltung wurde kurz unterbrochen.","en":"The conversation was briefly interrupted.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"short, quick, brief"},{"g":"to interrupt","l":"unterbrechen"}]},{"text":"Er störte unsere Unterhaltung.","en":"He broke in on our conversation.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to disturb","l":"stören"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null]},{"text":"In der Unterhaltung kam ein neues Thema auf.","en":"A new topic came up in conversation.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"topic, subject, issue"},{"g":"on"}]},{"text":"Ich wollte eure Unterhaltung nicht belauschen.","en":"I didn't mean to eavesdrop on your conversation.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"your","l":"euer"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to overhear"}]}]}